---
const title = "TwilightLog";
const description = "TwilightLog 公开站占位页";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="eyebrow">TWILIGHTLOG / LOCAL</p>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p>公开站骨架已就绪。后续在这里接入首页、文章和摄影页面。</p>
      <p>
        API 健康检查：<a href="/healthz">/healthz</a> ·
        <a href="/readyz">/readyz</a>
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    background: #f3efe6;
    color: #171717;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 12vh auto;
    padding: 48px 32px;
    border: 2px solid #171717;
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #171717;
    background: #fffdf8;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  a {
    color: #b45309;
  }
</style>
